Package: PhyloSOLIDvis
Title: Visualization Suite for PhyloSOLID Phylogenetic Trees
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Qing", "Yang", 
           email = "qing.yang@westlake.edu.cn", 
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-7366-6879")),
    person("Westlake University", 
           role = "cph",
           comment = "School of Life Sciences")
)
Description: Generate circular (circos-style) phylogenetic tree visualizations 
    with integrated mutation heatmaps, cell annotations, and genotype flipping markers.
    Designed for PhyloSOLID output. Implements recursive clone partitioning, adaptive 
    parameter estimation, and publication-ready figures.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/yourusername/PhyloSOLIDvis
BugReports: https://github.com/yourusername/PhyloSOLIDvis/issues
Acknowledgments: 
    We thank Yonghe Xia for initial conceptualization of the visualization approach 
    and for providing the converTree package (https://github.com/xiayh17/converTree), 
    which is used for tree construction from conflict-free matrices.

